  "abstract": "Falsify oscillatory recurrence: replace with 1st-order diagonal y_t=a*y_{t-1}. Invariances: forward U/V normalization, LayerNorm before gating. Base k=320,p=32,H=96,\u03b3_end=0.99. Loss: MAE+curvature (\u03bb=1e-4) + tiny V-ortho (\u03bb=1e-6).",
